			§ TCP 17790 – Optional for real-time command execution.
	2. Server-Initiated Mode (Push Mode)
		○ The SolarWinds server contacts the agent to request data.
		○ Best for devices on the same network or with an open firewall.
		○ Ports Used:
			§ TCP 17778 (HTTPS) – Secure communication.
			§ TCP 17791 – Used for remote deployment and control.

2. SNMP (Simple Network Management Protocol)
Used to monitor network devices like routers, switches, and firewalls.
